--- !u!114 &8738204726173900910
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5802222969651682958}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: Turkey
    Text: "Bu ma\u011Faza men\xFCs\xFCd\xFCr, buradan operasyonlar i\xE7in sava\u015F\xE7\u0131
      ve ekipman sat\u0131n alabilirsiniz"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044E \u043C\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0437\u0438\u043D\u0430,
      \u0442\u0430\u043C \u0442\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043A\u0443\u043F\u0438\u0442\u044C
      \u0431\u043E\u0439\u0446\u043E\u0432 \u0438 \u043E\u0431\u043E\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043D\u0438\u0435
      \u0434\u043B\u044F \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F
      \u043E\u043F\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0439"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: This is the store menu, there you can buy fighters and equipment for operations
    Object: {fileID: 0}
